      "id": "sw.sec.mighty-saga",
      "name": "Mighty Saga",
      "text": "At the start of round 1, pick one enemy CHARACTER, MONSTER or VEHICLE model. At the end of the battle: 8 victory points if that model was destroyed, or 12 if its unit was destroyed by your BATTLE LEADER model's own attacks.",
